SUMMARY:Give Microsoft AI Agents Communication Superpowers
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nIn this webinar\, you'll learn how 
 to use Infobip's MCP servers to give your AI agents running on Azure commu
 nication tools.\n\nFrom personal Al assistants to scalable customer suppor
 t and marketing agents\, discover how to build agents that reach\, engage\
 , and deliver outcomes through global communications.
